Title: Caliban and the Witch: Women, the Body and Primitive Accumulation
Captured: 2026-03-26T01:14:45.914Z

A historical and sociological study exploring the transition from feudalism to capitalism, the history of the body, and the witch hunts of the 16th and 17th centuries as essential to the rise of the capitalist system.